### Attribution and Third-Party Notices

This project relies on and builds upon the authoritative disassembly of NES Tetris:
- **TetrisNESDisasm**: https://github.com/CelestialAmber/TetrisNESDisasm
  Disassembly created and maintained by Amber Brault (CelestialAmber) and contributors.
- **taus**: https://github.com/ejona86/taus
  Original disassembly data, info files, and research by ejona86.
- **nes-util**: https://github.com/qalle2/nes-util
  CHR PNG converting tools by qalle2.

